    <section id="w-form-customer-guidance">
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">W Form and Customer Guidance</title>
      <p>Please click for the IRS W forms, including instructions on how to complete them.</p>
      <p>In order to provide customers with further support when completing IRS W Forms, we have provided some additional customer guidance for:</p>
      <p> <b>W-9</b>, <b>W-8BEN</b>, and <b>W-8BEN-E</b>. </p>
    </section>
    <!-- Section for Withholding Statements -->
    <section id="withholding-statements">
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Withholding Statements</title>
      <p>A range of Withholding Statements have been produced, which can be used when providing a Form W-8IMY.</p>
    </section>
    <!-- Section for Global Intermediary Identification Numbers -->
    <section id="giin">
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Global Intermediary Identification Numbers</title>
      <p>FSI has published its Global Intermediary Identification Numbers (FSI GIINs).</p>
    </section>
    <!-- Section for FATCA Information by Country -->
    <section id="fatca-country-info">
      <title outputclass="chapter_sub-titles">Find out more about FATCA in your country or territory</title>
      <p>To find out more about FATCA in your country or territory (including relevant tax forms and guidance) and how it affects you, please select the appropriate business line (and country or territory, if relevant) from the navigation headings above.</p>
      <p>Country or territory pages will continue to be updated with the most recent information as it becomes available.</p>
    </section>
